#: ../../source/docs/failsafe.rst:5 37515658c5074973a839764526d2fb76
msgid "Failsafe Setup"
msgstr "失控保护设置"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe.rst:7 47341175d5cc4587a318c61deaa6e359
msgid ""
"Since the Blimp code is very new, limited failsafe behavior is currently "
"provided and is expected to improve and evolve over time."
msgstr "由于 Blimp 代码非常新，目前提供的失控保护行为较为有限，并会随时间持续完善和演进。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe.rst:9 e21967f4ba8142fea1cdf6b8028b56a8
msgid "Blimp provides several failsafes which can be enabled or disabled:"
msgstr "Blimp 提供了多种可启用或禁用的失控保护："

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe.rst:11 65971bfccca943a882b053433ce1c049
msgid ""
"RC loss via :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>`, always disarms on any RC "
"failsafe. \"0\" ignores RC failsafes"
msgstr ""
"RC 丢失保护通过 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 启用；任何 RC 失控保护触发时总是会上锁。「0」表示忽略 "
"RC 失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe.rst:12 c75a63cd5c104c4bb2936db0f7fa39ba
msgid ""
"Ground Control Station via :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE<FS_GCS_ENABLE>`, any non-zero"
" value enables disarming after :ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT<FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` seconds"
" of GCS connection failure. \"0\" ignores GCS connection failures."
msgstr ""
"地面站失控保护通过 :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE<FS_GCS_ENABLE>` 启用；任何非零值表示在地面站连接失败 "
":ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT<FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` 秒后上锁。「0」表示忽略 GCS 连接失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe.rst:13 d4f2a5e1376e40afaf561f2f19d18a1f
msgid ""
"EKF Failsafe, when EKF is determined to be unhealthy, "
":ref:`FS_EKF_ACTION<FS_EKF_ACTION>` occurs"
msgstr "EKF 失控保护：当 EKF 被判定为不健康时，执行 :ref:`FS_EKF_ACTION<FS_EKF_ACTION>` 指定动作"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe.rst:14 4b0053a60ecb453389304312027fe5cf
msgid "Vibration Failsafe via :ref:`FS_VIBE_ENABLE<FS_VIBE_ENABLE>`"
msgstr "震动失控保护通过 :ref:`FS_VIBE_ENABLE<FS_VIBE_ENABLE>` 启用"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe.rst:15 2533e88f81fb4428a4b66647579d85de
msgid ""
"Battery Failsafe via :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT<BATT_LOW_VOLT>` and "
":ref:`BATT_CRT_VOLT<BATT_CRT_VOLT>`,always disarms currently, independent of"
" failsafe action selected by the :ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT<BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` and"
" :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` parameters."
msgstr ""
"电池失控保护通过 :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT<BATT_LOW_VOLT>` 与 "
":ref:`BATT_CRT_VOLT<BATT_CRT_VOLT>` 启用；当前一律执行上锁，与 "
":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT<BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` 和 "
":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` 参数所选择的失控保护动作无关。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe.rst:17 171a7e3a076a4f61a50e4b580639b641
msgid ""
"setting :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` to 1 also allows throttle values"
" below :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` to force a failsafe in addition to "
"RC loss or corruption. Be sure its set below any active throttle channel "
"value to avoid triggering a failsafe unintentionally while demanding maximum"
" descent."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 设置为 1 时，除 RC 丢失或损坏外，油门值低于 "
":ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` "
"也会触发失控保护。请务必把该阈值设置在所有有效油门通道值以下，以免在请求最大下降速率时意外触发失控保护。"
